# Template .gitignore for Task Management System
# Copy relevant parts to your .gitignore

# =============================================================================
# PERSONAL OS CORE
# =============================================================================

# Personal task files
03_Task/*.md
!03_Task/.gitkeep
!03_Task/README.md

# Matrix files (personal)
00_Winter_is_Coming/BACKLOG.md

# Personal knowledge files
01_Personal_Os/02_Knowledge/*.md
!01_Personal_Os/02_Knowledge/.gitkeep
!01_Personal_Os/02_Knowledge/README.md

# Keep templates and examples
!config.example.yaml
!Tasks/example.md
!CRM/example.md

# =============================================================================
# PYTHON
# =============================================================================

